        "subject": "LU-17920 tests: improve checkpatch.pl return checks",
        "message": "LU-17920 tests: improve checkpatch.pl return checks\n\nThe checkpatch.pl return code check, USE_NEGATIVE_ERRNO warning\nonly triggers on the most basic \"return EPOS\" error code, not\nfor \"(rc|ret|retval|err) = EPOS; return rc;\" or \"ERR_PTR(EPOS)\".\n\nFix the USE_NEGATIVE_ERRNO check to detect and report those cases.\n\nFalse positives were hit in the MGC llog and PtlRPC connect handling.\nAdd comments when setting and checking to explain this is intentional.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I2ca613bdbec052e21e8ff8fbd6044290823ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65952\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
